# POLLY, the Song page's clocks: the section playing shows how far it has gone, a ring filling clockwise from 12
# o'clock in place of its number; the Intro and the Ending theirs before their pill over the rows. Two sections of P1
# (4 bars, Pop 105 BPM: a bar 2286 ms), the first x2.
wait 300
tap HOME
expect page 1
tapkey w0
tapkey w0
expect rows 2
turn K1 -2
expect cursor 1
turn K4 1
expect row_rep1 2
tap PLAY
wait 1500
expect playing 1
expect sect 1
shot clock_intro.png
wait 3100
expect sect 2
expect row 1
shot clock_0.png
wait 4570
shot clock_25.png
wait 4570
shot clock_50.png
wait 4570
shot clock_75.png
wait 4570
expect row 2
shot clock_next.png
wait 9200
expect sect 6
shot clock_ending.png
tap PLAY
